WP08 Rust protocol and parser proof

Commands:
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-protocol app_game_runtime
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game_windows_process_runtime

Result:
PASS

Observed output:
- agent-protocol: 1 passed; 0 failed
- agent-core: 6 passed; 0 failed

Protocol parity covered:
- `AppGameRuntimeEvidenceRow` serializes to camelCase TypeScript-facing fields.
- Process id, parent process id, process identity, metadata refs, runtime state,
  foreground state, observation mode, classification, catalog, capability, and
  confidence fields survive serde.
- Runtime row uses protocol constants instead of service/core-local field names.

Parser proof covered:
- process appears and creates runtime evidence;
- same process persists and session can continue;
- process exits and session can close;
- unknown process remains unknown without deterministic refs;
- launcher process stays launcher/runtime-only;
- permission-limited metadata remains explicit;
- runtime evidence never claims foreground.
